"""latent — env ABI as two columns: DUE (owed by the load image) vs LATENT (consulted on a run).

The owed set is not the used set. lode harvested getenv names from otool -L / ldd
images. latent keeps that column and adds a traced getenv column.

TSV: name<TAB>source<TAB>due|latent|both
"""

